{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46474","headline":"蝉八韵 · 齐己","name":"蝉八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"咽咽复啾啾，多来自早秋。\n园林凉正好，风雨思相收。\n在处声无别，何人泪欲流。\n冷怜天露滴，伤共野禽游。\n静息深依竹，惊移瞥过楼。\n分明晴渡口，凄切暮关头。\n时节推应定，飞鸣即未休。\n年年闻尔苦，远忆所居幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}